  "Bank {bank} gold · carrying {gold} gold. Purchases are paid from the bank (then from your backpack) and delivered to your depot.": ["Bank: {bank} złota · przy sobie {gold} złota. Zakupy są opłacane z banku (potem z plecaka) i trafiają do depozytu.", "Banco: {bank} de ouro · carregando {gold} de ouro. As compras são pagas pelo banco (depois pela mochila) e entregues no seu depósito."],
  "The market is closed for now. Your offers and items are safe.": ["Targ jest na razie zamknięty. Twoje oferty i przedmioty są bezpieczne.", "O mercado está fechado por enquanto. Suas ofertas e itens estão seguros."],
